{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52232","headline":"颂六十二首 五十七 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 五十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五体悔前朝，三屈忏中夕。\n鸣椎诫旭旦，哀我苦劳役。\n引目寓金言，悲伤尘垢积。\n咄哉形非我，嗟往恒沉溺。\n踟蹰歧路嵎，挥手谢中折。\n洗涤归诚忏，皎洁凌云释。\n萧索业苦离，升陟随缘益。\n虽未齐高踪，且免幽途历。\n（见同书卷一百三《洗忏部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}